{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "agritrace-auth-collection-2024",
    "name": "AgriTrace API – Auth & Authorization",
    "description": "Collection test API cho AgriTrace.\n\n**⚠️ QUAN TRỌNG – Trước khi test:**\n1. API đang chạy trên **http://localhost:5103** (kiểm tra terminal)\n2. Chạy SQL seed tạo Admin đầu tiên vào DB trước\n3. Login Admin → lưu token → test các endpoint\n\n---\n\n**SQL seed Admin đầu tiên (password = Admin@123456):**\n```sql\nINSERT INTO Users (RoleId, Username, PasswordHash, Email, FullName, Status, CreatedAt)\nVALUES (\n  1,\n  'superadmin',\n  '$2a$12$LQv3c1yqBWVHxkd0LHAkCOYz6TiGniYE6Vc638D9QbGpFo8oaJCOq',\n  'superadmin@agritrace.com',\n  'Super Admin',\n  'Active',\n  GETUTCDATE()\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n**Quy tắc bảo mật:**\n- `/api/auth/register` → CHỈ tạo được role 2-7 (Farmer..Consumer)\n- `/api/admin/users/create` → Admin mới tạo được mọi role kể cả Admin",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5103",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "⚠️ Port 5103 – kiểm tra terminal khi dotnet run"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwtToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Tự động set sau khi Login"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔓 Public – Đăng ký & Đăng nhập",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register – Farmer (roleId=2) ✅",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"farmer_test\",\n  \"email\": \"farmer_test@agritrace.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@123456\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Nguyễn Văn Nông\",\n  \"roleId\": 2,\n  \"organizationId\": null\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "✅ Được phép – Farmer (roleId=2)\n**Expected:** 201 Created"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 – Register Success",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 201,\n  \"isSuccess\": true,\n  \"errorMessages\": [],\n  \"result\": {\n    \"userId\": 10,\n    \"username\": \"farmer_test\",\n    \"email\": \"farmer_test@agritrace.com\",\n    \"role\": \"Farmer\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Register – Processor (roleId=3) ✅",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"processor_test\",\n  \"email\": \"processor_test@agritrace.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@123456\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Đơn Vị Sơ Chế\",\n  \"roleId\": 3,\n  \"organizationId\": 3\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "✅ Được phép – Processor (roleId=3)\n**Expected:** 201 Created"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Register – Inspector (roleId=6) ✅",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"inspector_test\",\n  \"email\": \"inspector_test@agritrace.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@123456\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Kiểm Định Viên\",\n  \"roleId\": 6,\n  \"organizationId\": null\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "✅ Được phép – Inspector (roleId=6)\n**Expected:** 201 Created"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Register – Admin (roleId=1) ❌ BỊ CHẶN",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"hacker_admin\",\n  \"email\": \"hacker@evil.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Hack@123456\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Hacker\",\n  \"roleId\": 1,\n  \"organizationId\": null\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "❌ BỊ CHẶN – Không thể tự đăng ký Admin!\n**Expected:** 400 Bad Request"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "400 – Admin blocked",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 400,\n  \"isSuccess\": false,\n  \"errorMessages\": [\"Cannot self-register as Admin. Admin accounts must be created by an existing administrator.\"],\n  \"result\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login – Admin ⭐ (Auto-save Token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.isSuccess && body.result && body.result.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('jwtToken', body.result.token);",
                  "        console.log('✅ ADMIN Token saved! Role:', body.result.role, '| User:', body.result.username);",
                  "    }",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('❌ Login failed - Status:', pm.response.code);",
                  "    console.log('Response:', pm.response.text());",
                  "    console.log('⚠️ Nếu 404/401: User chưa tồn tại trong DB - chạy SQL seed trước!');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"superadmin\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@123456\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login Admin → tự động lưu `{{jwtToken}}`\n\n⚠️ **Nếu lỗi:** Chạy SQL seed trong DB trước:\n```sql\nINSERT INTO Users (RoleId, Username, PasswordHash, Email, FullName, Status, CreatedAt)\nVALUES (1, 'superadmin', '$2a$12$LQv3c1yqBWVHxkd0LHAkCOYz6TiGniYE6Vc638D9QbGpFo8oaJCOq', 'superadmin@agritrace.com', 'Super Admin', 'Active', GETUTCDATE());\n```\n\n**Expected:** 200 OK với JWT token"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 – Login OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 200,\n  \"isSuccess\": true,\n  \"errorMessages\": [],\n  \"result\": {\n    \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n    \"userId\": 1,\n    \"username\": \"superadmin\",\n    \"email\": \"superadmin@agritrace.com\",\n    \"fullName\": \"Super Admin\",\n    \"role\": \"Admin\",\n    \"organizationId\": null,\n    \"expiresAt\": \"2026-08-14T00:00:00Z\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 – User không tồn tại",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 401,\n  \"isSuccess\": false,\n  \"errorMessages\": [\"Invalid username or password.\"],\n  \"result\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login – Farmer ⭐ (Auto-save Token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.isSuccess && body.result && body.result.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('jwtToken', body.result.token);",
                  "        console.log('✅ Farmer Token saved! Role:', body.result.role);",
                  "    }",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('❌ Login failed:', pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"farmer_test\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@123456\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login Farmer (đăng ký trước tại Register – Farmer)\n→ tự động lưu `{{jwtToken}}`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔐 Protected – Cần Token",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/auth/me ✅",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwtToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Lấy thông tin user hiện tại.\n\n✅ Có token → 200 OK\n❌ Không token → 401"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/auth/me – Không token ❌ (test 401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Test 401 – không có token.\n**Expected:** 401 Unauthorized"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👑 Admin – Chỉ Role Admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/admin/users/create – Tạo Admin ⭐",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwtToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin_new\",\n  \"email\": \"admin_new@agritrace.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@123456\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Admin Mới\",\n  \"roleId\": 1,\n  \"organizationId\": null\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/create",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "users", "create"]
            },
            "description": "**[Admin only]** Tạo Admin mới.\n\n✅ Token Admin → 201 Created\n⛔ Token Farmer → 403 Forbidden\n❌ Không token → 401"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/admin/users/create – Tạo Distributor",
          "request": {
